{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_01:1_5_015_01:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_01:1_5_015_01:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_01:1_5_015_01:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_01:1_5_015_01:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b3d9befc3bf8af18475b95d472f93801378b6ae11c98ba6e3fef9c126e7fbc5",
      "text": "救援行动情景再现剧的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_01:1_5_015_01:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81a4abd100dba56702862f05eaba227ce06deb63bb2617482ff978576219292e",
      "text": "没想到我居然能出演救援行动的情景再现剧！\n太高兴了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_01:1_5_015_01:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40e02b6c1064e20cb3fabd9eb7df7d0ad1d17873e314c572222342cfee21b661",
      "text": "从接到这份工作的时候起，我就想着\n一定要拜托龙先生来演呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_01:1_5_015_01:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e7fdfddbb71b8cc14c1d15b91fa14fbdb05ac7e97183b29c49ea79a8d206236",
      "text": "我超级高兴的！为了这一天，俯卧撑和\n长跑我都练得足足的了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_01:1_5_015_01:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d0eadf9c0864c6efc76f69d38e785b6a6f779dc6248483a8dfbf63bb0b8df3c",
      "text": "就算是演戏，只要认真对待，观众也一定能感受到救援行动的重要性吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_01:1_5_015_01:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef2dd1bb0c669081bbeaf4f47cd060b12da67a9fe0c51daba30b2143e4135443",
      "text": "救援行动是多么帅气、多么重要的工作啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_01:1_5_015_01:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a102f9e9c071a78b556178d3246cab96a144fd959508559ff3ea9d6171bf203f",
      "text": "只要让大家看到认真投入的龙先生的身影，\n这份心意一定能传达到的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_01:1_5_015_01:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae231500bca673e1da66cc98c829ffb0e10ce3750747b40349dce1b95181a96a",
      "text": "谢谢！\n多亏了你，我更有干劲了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_01:1_5_015_01:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b486d3d9150bbace4c45b472388198e5d2ae1c20557727b2d808bf85e0ebed1",
      "text": "哎呀，差不多要开始拍摄了呢。\n那我就去啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_01:1_5_015_01:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6205db2c6e3eb02b9713aebbf69a5e1cbe2e6472119aa217ff6a811fc9521680",
      "text": "好的，路上请多小心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_01:1_5_015_01:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c91028dbc07e24e040b80da55b1352faf96d87c05532452b2849938f3af494b",
      "text": "嗯！●●●●プロデューサー也千万不要眨眼，\n好好看着我的表现哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
